OL,3,GNEWSAFontaines D.C.'s frontman on why
OL,4,Ahe wore semi-pro football club's shirt
OL,5,Aat Reading Festival
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe semi-professional club had
OL,8,Fpartnered with four famous bands for
OL,9,Ftheir 2026/27 season team kits, with
OL,10,Fsales of the shirt going towards
OL,11,Fsupporting the club and grassroots
OL,12,Fmusic venues.
OL,14,FIn a statement to BBC Wales, Chatten
OL,15,Fsaid: "I love Cwmbran and I love
OL,16,Finitiatives that support independent
OL,17,Fvenues."
